  positionTitle: Office Manager
  jobDescription: Keep the office running. Order supplies. Stop the fridge from becoming
    a biohazard.
  bossMemo: 'Today we need an Office Manager. The last one went to ''get printer
    toner'' in March and never came back. We found her desk covered in sticky notes
    that just say ''NO''.


    HR added rules about certificates. Apparently someone
    ''certified'' themselves with a home printer.


    - Dale'
  newRules:
  - Certifications must list a certificate ID number.
  - '''Senior'', ''Lead'', ''Chief'' or fancier titles require 5+ years of experience.'
